## Spread — expand

```js
// Arrays
const a = [1, 2];
const b = [3, 4];
const merged = [...a, ...b];          // [1, 2, 3, 4]
const copy   = [...a];                // shallow clone

// Function call — replaces .apply()
Math.max(...[1, 3, 2]);               // 3
Math.max.apply(null, [1,3,2]);        // same (legacy)

// Objects (ES2018)
const user    = { name: 'Aaron' };
const updated = { ...user, role: 'dev' }; // shallow merge
```

## Rest — collect

```js
// Function parameters — collects remaining args:
function first(a, b, ...rest) {
  console.log(a);    // 1
  console.log(b);    // 2
  console.log(rest); // [3, 4, 5]
}
first(1, 2, 3, 4, 5);

// Array destructuring:
const [head, ...tail] = [1, 2, 3, 4]; // tail = [2,3,4]

// Object destructuring:
const { id, ...attrs } = { id: 1, name: 'A', age: 30 };
// attrs = { name: 'A', age: 30 }
```

## Key difference

```
Spread: [1,2] → 1, 2   (array to elements — expands)
Rest:   1, 2  → [1,2]  (elements to array — collects)
```

detailMdTr:
## Spread — genişlet

```js
// Diziler
const a = [1, 2];
const b = [3, 4];
const merged = [...a, ...b];          // [1, 2, 3, 4]
const copy   = [...a];                // sığ klon

// Fonksiyon çağrısı — .apply() yerine geçer
Math.max(...[1, 3, 2]);               // 3
Math.max.apply(null, [1,3,2]);        // aynı (eski)

// Nesneler (ES2018)
const user    = { name: 'Aaron' };
const updated = { ...user, role: 'dev' }; // sığ birleştirme
```

## Rest — topla

```js
// Fonksiyon parametreleri — kalan argümanları toplar:
function first(a, b, ...rest) {
  console.log(a);    // 1
  console.log(b);    // 2
  console.log(rest); // [3, 4, 5]
}
first(1, 2, 3, 4, 5);

// Dizi destructuring:
const [head, ...tail] = [1, 2, 3, 4]; // tail = [2,3,4]

// Nesne destructuring:
const { id, ...attrs } = { id: 1, name: 'A', age: 30 };
// attrs = { name: 'A', age: 30 }
```

## Temel fark

```
Spread: [1,2] → 1, 2   (dizi → elemanlara — genişler)
Rest:   1, 2  → [1,2]  (elemanlar → diziye — toplar)
```

